          %p (…)
          %h2#properties Properties
          %h3#general General
          %ul
            %li
              Homotopy Kan fibrations participate in a
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/pullback-power+axiom"} pullback-power axiom
              with (acyclic) homotopy cofibrations as expected in a
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/monoidal+model+category"} monoidal model category
              (
              %a{:href => "#MazelGee15"}> Mazel-Gee 2015, Def. 4.3 with Exp. 5.3
              )
          %h3#relation_to_homotopy_colimits_geometric_realization Relation to homotopy colimits (geometric realization)
          %p
            See at
            %em
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/geometric+realization+of+simplicial+topological+spaces"} geometric realization of simplicial topological spaces
            the section
            = succeed "." do
              %em
                %a{:href => "geometric+realization+of+simplicial+topological+spaces#PreservationOfHomotopyLimits"} Preservation of homotopy limits
          %h2#related_concepts Related concepts
          %ul
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Kan+fibration"} Kan fibration
            %li
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/model+%28infinity%2C1%29-category"}
                  model
                  = succeed "-category" do
                    %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                      %semantics
                        %mrow
                          %mn ∞
                        %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \infty
          %h2#references References
          %ul
            %li#Lurie11
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Jacob+Lurie"}> Jacob Lurie
                ,
                = succeed "," do
                  %em Simplicial spaces
                = succeed "," do
                  %em
                    %a{:href => "https://www.math.ias.edu/~lurie/287x.html"} Algebraic L-theory and Surgery
                = succeed ")" do
                  %a{:href => "https://www.math.ias.edu/~lurie/287xnotes/Lecture7.pdf"} pdf
            %li#MazelGee14
              %p
                %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/Aaron+Mazel-Gee"}> Aaron Mazel-Gee
                ,
                %em
                  Model
